 ### Surfacing
 
-Breaching the surface any point during the mission causes <span class="emphasis">end of the current attempt</span>, the total points for that attempt will be computed based on the tasks accomplished in that attempt and the timing bonus (if applicable) and a <span class="info">5 Points</span> surfacing bonus for ending. The team may wish to retry if they still have time left.
